        last quarter", not "since inception". Mega-cap tech is dashed — context, not part of the
        semiconductor complex.<br><br>
        <b>This line and the table's 63-day column now agree exactly</b> — same maths, same window.
        Where the chart ends is what the table prints.
        <b>The chart is a 63-day window</b>, so a group can be ahead here while the
        table's 21-day column shows it losing — a group that ran up and then reversed.
